  "goodToKnow": "Der Urheber is the creator or originator of something: der Urheber eines Werkes (the author of a work), or der Urheber eines Gerüchts (the source of a rumour). Das Urheberrecht is copyright, and in Germany it lasts for 70 years after the creator's death; unlike in the USA, it can't be sold outright, only licensed. Urheberrechtlich geschützt means protected by copyright. Plural: die Urheber."
